scripts/install.sh-2270-# PLAN-138 Wave C (ADR-155) — write the baseline SHA-256 manifest.
scripts/install.sh-2271-#
scripts/install.sh-2272-# Records, per framework-owned file, a baseline digest so a later upgrade can
scripts/install.sh-2273-# tell "the framework changed this" apart from "the adopter changed this" and
scripts/install.sh-2274-# PRESERVE/REFUSE customizations instead of clobbering them (incl. the root
scripts/install.sh-2275-# PROTOCOL.md — the verified S238 driver). The enumeration is the SINGLE shared
scripts/install.sh:2276:# set from _framework_manifest_set.sh, so the manifest writer (here) and the
scripts/install.sh-2277-# upgrade classifier walk an identical list.
scripts/install.sh-2278-#
scripts/install.sh-2279-# Manifest grammar (two record kinds):
