  1558	def test_integrity_unenforced_rows_are_restated_where_the_reader_looks():
  1559	    """The escape hatch a closed set alone leaves open: mark everything
  1560	    `deferred` and list it nowhere. Every non-enforced row must repeat its
  1561	    control name, verbatim and bold, under §Not yet automated — the section a
  1562	    reader actually reads."""
