  1868	def test_checklist_enumerates_the_verdict_fields_the_tag_guard_requires():
  1869	    """The tag guard enforces FOUR verdict fields; the canonical template
  1870	    (.claude/governance/pair-rail-verdict-template.md, W1 ceremony scope)
  1871	    still documents only parent_sha. Until that patch lands, the checklist is
  1872	    the authoring surface — a contract enforced by code but documented on no
